to respond to that topic.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.454
So since they just announced
the "Sex and the City" reboot,

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:25.892 line:0%
I sent out a hashtag,
"Describe a TV show badly,"

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.093 line:0%
where I asked you guys
to take a TV show

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:29.195 line:0%
and then give it a funny
or weird summary.

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.430 line:0%
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:32.898 line:0%
All day, by the way.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:35.467
Trended all day.
Thank you for playing along.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.437
We appreciate that, guys.

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:39.138
